---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Cain Macias — Business Systems & Automation"
  description="Cain Macias builds practical business systems, enterprise integrations, and Python automation from South Texas."
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="site-name" href="/" aria-label="Cain Macias home"><span class="brand-mark">c<span>.</span></span> cain macias</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="site-nav">
      <a href="/projects">work</a>
      <a href="/about">about</a>
      <a href="/gear">gear</a>
      <a class="nav-contact" href="mailto:cainmacias69@gmail.com">let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> SOUTH TEXAS · BUSINESS SYSTEMS & SOFTWARE</p>
      <h1 id="intro-title">I make business systems <span>work better.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro-copy">Hey, I’m Cain — an operations-minded systems builder working across enterprise software, data, integrations, and automation. I like finding the friction in a workflow and building something practical to remove it.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="primary-link" href="/projects">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="secondary-link" href="mailto:cainmacias69@gmail.com">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-tags">
        <span>Enterprise systems</span><span>Python automation</span><span>Data & integrations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-visual">
      <div class="portrait-frame">
        <img src="/profile.jpg" alt="Portrait of Cain Anthony Macias" class="profile-photo" />
        <span class="portrait-corner portrait-corner-tl"></span><span class="portrait-corner portrait-corner-br"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="portrait-caption"><span class="caption-line"></span><span>BUILDING USEFUL THINGS, ONE WORKFLOW AT A TIME</span></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="featured-panel feature-spotlight" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
    <div class="feature-spotlight-top">
      <span class="eyebrow">FEATURED BUILD / 2026</span>
      <span class="status-pill"><span class="status-dot"></span> Current project</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-spotlight-layout">
      <div class="feature-spotlight-copy">
        <p class="feature-overline">ENGINEERING THE BACK OFFICE</p>
        <h2 id="featured-title">JEANSRS<span>.OPS</span></h2>
        <p class="feature-lead">A connected operations platform for the messy space between ERP data, catalog pricing, customer workflows, and human-approved AI.</p>
        <ul class="feature-highlights">
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> ERP + vendor catalog reconciliation</li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> Reviewable pricing and compliance workflows</li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> AI agent tools with human decision gates</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="feature-explore" href="/projects/jeansrs-ops">Explore the architecture <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-system" aria-label="Simplified JEANSRS.OPS architecture">
        <div class="feature-system-head">
          <span>OPERATIONS / SYSTEM MAP</span>
          <span class="feature-system-indicator" aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-system-inputs">
          <span>EPICOR</span><span>AUTOQUOTES</span><span>SERVICE APIS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-system-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="feature-system-core">
          <span class="feature-system-core-caption">CONTROL LAYER</span>
          <strong>JEANSRS.OPS</strong>
          <small>integrate · validate · orchestrate</small>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-system-connector feature-system-connector-down" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="feature-system-outputs">
          <span>PRICING</span><span>CRM</span><span>AI TOOLS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-system-guard"><span class="feature-system-guard-dot"></span> HUMAN APPROVAL + RUN HISTORY</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-spotlight-bottom">
      <div class="feature-stat"><strong>18</strong><span>AUTOMATION HOOK ROUTES</span></div>
      <div class="feature-stat"><strong>200</strong><span>RECORD IMPORT CHUNKS</span></div>
      <div class="feature-stat"><strong>APPROVALS</strong><span>BEFORE HIGH-IMPACT AI ACTIONS</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE SHORT VERSION</p><h2 id="now-title">What I’m focused on</h2></div><span class="section-index">01 / FOCUS</span></div>
    <div class="focus-grid">
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="card-number">01</span><span class="focus-icon">↔</span><h3>Systems integration</h3><p>Helping ERP, CRM, and operations platforms share cleaner data and support real business workflows.</p></article>
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="card-number">02</span><span class="focus-icon">⌘</span><h3>Automation & data quality</h3><p>Building Python tools for catalog reconciliation, change detection, validation, and repeatable reporting.</p></article>
      <article class="focus-card"><span class="card-number">03</span><span class="focus-icon">▤</span><h3>Practical software</h3><p>Developing web tools and internal workflows with an emphasis on usability, maintainability, and measurable value.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section work-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED PROJECTS</p><h2 id="work-title">A few things I’ve worked on</h2></div><a class="subtle-link" href="/projects">All projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <ul class="work-list">
      <li><a href="/projects/jeansrs-ops"><span class="work-number">01</span><span class="work-main"><span class="work-name">JEANSRS.OPS — enterprise operations platform</span><span class="work-description">Integration architecture, catalog pipelines, and human-supervised AI.</span></span><span class="work-meta">CURRENT BUILD</span><span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/projects/python-automation-engine"><span class="work-number">01</span><span class="work-main"><span class="work-name">Python automation & reconciliation</span><span class="work-description">Vendor pricing checks, catalog matching, and automated reporting.</span></span><span class="work-meta">AUTOMATION</span><span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/projects/enterprise-migration"><span class="work-number">02</span><span class="work-main"><span class="work-name">Enterprise system migration</span><span class="work-description">Moving operational records between business platforms with audit checks.</span></span><span class="work-meta">INTEGRATION</span><span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/projects/b2b-ordering-platform"><span class="work-number">03</span><span class="work-main"><span class="work-name">B2B ordering platform</span><span class="work-description">Account-based ordering, tiered pricing, and web application infrastructure.</span></span><span class="work-meta">WEB APP</span><span class="work-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-panel">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">HAVE A GOOD PROBLEM?</p><h2>Let’s build something useful.</h2><p>I’m always happy to talk systems, automation, analytics, and better ways to get work done.</p></div>
    <a class="primary-link" href="mailto:cainmacias69@gmail.com">Say hello <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>

  <footer class="site-footer"><span>© 2026 Cain Macias</span><span>Made with curiosity in Texas <span class="footer-spark">✳</span></span><div><a href="https://github.com/BrownYumYum" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href="mailto:cainmacias69@gmail.com">Email ↗</a></div></footer>
</Layout>
